{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contain is a first-person cooperative tactical shooter, but if you like you can play as a Lone Wolf. There is an organization that directs many task forces that are trying to control objects of supernatural origin that have fallen from space. The story centers on a special task force. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/CyC.png?t=1739455158\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/Character.gif?t=1739455158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully customize your character from basic outfit and gear to in-depth customization, you decide on every pouch and attachment placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/CyW.png?t=1739455158\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/Gunsmith.gif?t=1739455158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Like your outfit and gear, you can fully customize your guns with a gunsmith system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/CG.png?t=1739455158\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/CoOp.gif?t=1739455158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Calculated teamwork is essential for all Entry Teams. Practice in the kill house and try your equipment before the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/PaS.png?t=1739455158\" />You will be able to play all the missions by yourself as a Lone Wolf. <i>But we are also planning to add A.I. teammates with a complete commanding system.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2186700?t=1739455158","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2186700?t=1739455158","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739455158","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739455158","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood Violence Strong Language"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contain is a first-person cooperative tactical shooter, but if you like you can play as a Lone Wolf. There is an organization that directs many task forces that are trying to control objects of supernatural origin that have fallen from space. The story centers on a special task force. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/CyC.png?t=1739455158\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/Character.gif?t=1739455158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully customize your character from basic outfit and gear to in-depth customization, you decide on every pouch and attachment placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/CyW.png?t=1739455158\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186